'''Water Orb'''{{Unofficial}} is water-type [[Spells|spell]] that creates an invisible spherical container for water

==Description==
Water Orb is a spell that consists of a inverted central water sigil, the inverted water sigil does not change its affect that we know of. The sigil is enclosed by two [[Signs Explained#Column|column signs]] on either side, and the central sigil is enclosed by four [[Signs Explained#Orb|orb signs]] one in each corner. This spell holds water in a invisible spherical container. {{Ref|m|53|19}}

==Usage==
[[Qifrey]] uses this spell when talking to [[Agott]] at [[Silver Eve]]

